# text = And the first cab having been fetched from the public-house , where he had been smoking his first pipe , Mr . Pickwick and his portmanteau were thrown into the vehicle said Mr . Pickwick cried the driver sulkily , for the information of his friend the waterman , as the cab drove off inquired Mr . Pickwick , rubbing his nose with the shilling he had reserved for the fare replied the driver , eyeing him askant ejaculated Mr . Pickwick , laying his hand upon his note-book .
