# text = Seven o'clock had hardly ceased striking on the following morning , when Mr . Pickwick's comprehensive mind was aroused from the state of unconsciousness , in which slumber had plunged it , by a loud knocking at his chamber door said Mr . Pickwick , starting up in bed thought Mr . Pickwick he called out said the Boots , and away he went cried Mr . Tupman , as a loud knocking at his door roused hint from his oblivious repose replied Boots from the outside shouted Mr . Tupman , calling into the inner room replied a faint voice from within the bed-clothes and , having exerted himself to articulate thus much , Mr . Tracy Tupman turned round and fell fast asleep again said Mr .
