# text = He was apparently about to proceed to do so , when Lieutenant Tappleton , who had been eyeing him with great curiosity , said with considerable scorn replied the unabashed stranger said the lieutenant contemptuously , turning to Doctor Slammer said the dignified Payne said Lieutenant Tappleton , addressing Mr . Pickwick and the lieutenant bounced out of the room said the irascible Doctor Payne Having concluded this speech , and uttered the last three words in a loud key , he stalked majestically after his friend , closely followed by Doctor Slammer , who said nothing , but contented himself by withering the company with a look .
