# text = Heaven forgive me the supposition , if it be an uncharitable one , but I do firmly and in my soul believe , that the man systematically tried for many years to break her heart ; but she bore it all for her child's sake , and , however strange it may seem to many , for his father's too ; for brute as he was , and cruelly as he had treated her , she had loved him once ; and the recollection of what he had been to her , awakened feelings of forbearance and meekness under suffering in her bosom , to which all God's creatures , but women , are strangers .
