# text = At length , during a moment of comparative silence , the little man called out in a very loud , solemn voice Everybody was hushed into a profound stillness as the individual addressed , replied Mr . Jingle uttered a patronising which was responded to by the remainder of the company ; and the glasses having been filled , the vice-president assumed an air of wisdom in a state of profound attention ; and said said the little man , rising suggested Mr . Jingle said the little man Here the little man ceased , and here the company commenced a raising of voices , and thumping of tables , which lasted with little intermission during the remainder of the evening .
