# text = It was the old lady's habit on the fine summer mornings to repair to the arbour in which Mr . Tupman had already signalised himself , in form and manner following : first , the fat boy fetched from a peg behind the old lady's bedroom door , a close black satin bonnet , a warm cotton shawl , and a thick stick with a capacious handle ; and the old lady , having put on the bonnet and shawl at her leisure , would lean one hand on the stick and the other on the fat boy's shoulder , and walk leisurely to the arbour , where the fat boy would leave her to enjoy the fresh air for the space of half an hour ; at the expiration of which time he would return and reconduct her to the house .
