# text = The old lady was very precise and very particular ; and as this ceremony had been observed for three successive summers without the slightest deviation from the accustomed form , she was not a little surprised on this particular morning to see the fat boy , instead of leaving the arbour , walk a few paces out of it , look carefully round him in every direction , and return towards her with great stealth and an air of the most profound mystery .
