# text = They were indeed , as was sufficiently testified to Mr . Pickwick , by his constant collision either with the hard wood-work of the chaise , or the body of his companion said the stout old Mr . Wardle , as Mr . Pickwick dived head foremost into his capacious waistcoat said Mr . Pickwick replied his companion Mr . Pickwick planted himself into his own corner , as firmly as he could ; and on whirled the chaise faster than ever .
