# text = A loud ringing of one of the bells was followed by the appearance of a smart chambermaid in the upper sleeping gallery , who , after tapping at one of the doors , and receiving a request from within , called over the balustrades replied the man with the white hat was the reply said the girl coaxingly said the boot-cleaner . ' Look at these here boots -- eleven pair o ' boots ; and one shoe as belongs to number six , with the wooden leg .
