# text = Clad in a tight suit of corduroy , spangled with brass buttons of a very considerable size , he at first stood at the door astounded and uncertain ; but by degrees , the impression that his mother must have suffered some personal damage pervaded his partially developed mind , and considering Mr . Pickwick as the aggressor , he set up an appalling and semi - earthly kind of howling , and butting forward with his head , commenced assailing that immortal gentleman about the back and legs , with such blows and pinches as the strength of his arm , and the violence of his excitement , allowed said the agonised Mr . Pickwick said the three tongue-tied Pickwickians replied Mr . Pickwick pettishly Here Mr .
