# text = Weller was furnished with a grey coat with the P . C . button , a black hat with a cockade to it , a pink striped waistcoat , light breeches and gaiters , and a variety of other necessaries , too numerous to recapitulate said that suddenly-transformed individual , as he took his seat on the outside of the Eatanswill coach next morning We will frankly acknowledge that , up to the period of our being first immersed in the voluminous papers of the Pickwick Club , we had never heard of Eatanswill ; we will with equal candour admit that we have in vain searched for proof of the actual existence of such a place at the present day .
