# text = Pott was discerned in one of the windows , by the mob beneath ; and tremendous was the enthusiasm when the Honourable Samuel Slumkey himself , in top-boots , and a blue neckerchief , advanced and seized the hand of the said Pott , and melodramatically testified by gestures to the crowd , his ineffaceable obligations to the Eatanswill GAZETTE said the Honourable Samuel Slumkey to Mr . Perker was the little man's reply said the Honourable Samuel Slumkey said the Honourable Samuel Slumkey said the cautious little man said the Honourable Samuel Slumkey replied the agent said the Honourable Samuel Slumkey , with a resigned air cried the twenty committee-men .
