# text = Amidst the cheers of the assembled throng , the band , and the constables , and the committee-men , and the voters , and the horsemen , and the carriages , took their places -- each of the two - horse vehicles being closely packed with as many gentlemen as could manage to stand upright in it ; and that assigned to Mr . Perker , containing Mr . Pickwick , Mr . Tupman , Mr . Snodgrass , and about half a dozen of the committee besides .
