# text = The proceedings had not yet commenced ; and as an inactive crowd is generally disposed to be jocose , this very innocent action was sufficient to awaken their facetiousness cried one voice cried another said a third shouted a fourth bellowed a fifth -- and then there was a roar of laughter .
