# text = But after a very few sentences of figurative eloquence , the pink-faced gentleman got from denouncing those who interrupted him in the mob , to exchanging defiances with the gentlemen on the hustings ; whereupon arose an uproar which reduced him to the necessity of expressing his feelings by serious pantomime , which he did , and then left the stage to his seconder , who delivered a written speech of half an hour's length , and wouldn't be stopped , because he had sent it all to the Eatanswill GAZETTE , and the Eatanswill GAZETTE had already printed it , every word .
