# text = Here it was that Mr . Tupman and Mr . Snodgrass were seated on the evening after the conclusion of the election , with several other temporary inmates of the house , smoking and drinking said a stout , hale personage of about forty , with only one eye -- a very bright black eye , which twinkled with a roguish expression of fun and good-humour said the hand-maiden , obviously not ill-pleased with the compliment , however said the black-eyed man said the young lady said the one-eyed man , calling after the girl as she left the room Here he went through the not very difficult process of winking upon the company with his solitary eye , to the enthusiastic delight of an elderly personage with a dirty face and a clay pipe said the dirty-faced man , after a pause said a very red-faced man , behind a cigar .
