# text = After this little bit of philosophy there was another pause said the man with the black eye , slowly filling a large Dutch pipe , with a most capacious bowl inquired the dirty-faced man Here the dirty-faced man fell into ecstasies of mirth at his own retort , in which he was joined by a man of bland voice and placid countenance , who always made it a point to agree with everybody said the enthusiastic Mr . Snodgrass said the placid gentleman interposed the dirty-faced man said the placid one said Mr . Snodgrass , whose thoughts were fast reverting to Emily Wardle And Mr . Snodgrass took his cigar from his mouth , and struck the table violently with his clenched fist said the placid man interrupted he of the dirty countenance said the placid gentleman said the bagman with the lonely eye , bestowing an approving nod on Mr . Snodgrass .
