# text = If any bagman of that day could have caught sight of the little neck-or-nothing sort of gig , with a clay - coloured body and red wheels , and the vixenish , ill tempered , fast-going bay mare , that looked like a cross between a butcher's horse and a twopenny post-office pony , he would have known at once , that this traveller could have been no other than Tom Smart , of the great house of Bilson and Slum , Cateaton Street , City .
