# text = This was comfortable , but this was not all ; for a smartly-dressed girl , with a bright eye and a neat ankle , was laying a very clean white cloth on the table ; and as Tom sat with his slippered feet on the fender , and his back to the open door , he saw a charming prospect of the bar reflected in the glass over the chimney-piece , with delightful rows of green bottles and gold labels , together with jars of pickles and preserves , and cheeses and boiled hams , and rounds of beef , arranged on shelves in the most tempting and delicious array .
