# text = Well , this was comfortable too ; but even this was not all -- for in the bar , seated at tea at the nicest possible little table , drawn close up before the brightest possible little fire , was a buxom widow of somewhere about eight-and-forty or thereabouts , with a face as comfortable as the bar , who was evidently the landlady of the house , and the supreme ruler over all these agreeable possessions .
