# text = There was only one drawback to the beauty of the whole picture , and that was a tall man -- a very tall man -- in a brown coat and bright basket buttons , and black whiskers and wavy black hair , who was seated at tea with the widow , and who it required no great penetration to discover was in a fair way of persuading her to be a widow no longer , but to confer upon him the privilege of sitting down in that bar , for and during the whole remainder of the term of his natural life .
