# text = He emptied his glass , looked mysteriously at his companion , winked both of his small eyes , one after the other , and finally made a motion with his arm , as if he were working an imaginary pump-handle ; thereby intimating that he ( Mr . Trotter ) considered himself as undergoing the process of being pumped by Mr . Samuel Weller said Mr . Trotter , in conclusion
