# text = THE PARISH CLERK A TALE OF TRUE LOVE ' Once upon a time , in a very small country town , at a considerable distance from London , there lived a little man named Nathaniel Pipkin , who was the parish clerk of the little town , and lived in a little house in the little High Street , within ten minutes' walk from the little church ; and who was to be found every day , from nine till four , teaching a little learning to the little boys .
