# text = But though he had often thought then , how briskly he would walk up to Maria Lobbs and tell her of his passion if he could only meet her , he felt , now that she was unexpectedly before him , all the blood in his body mounting to his face , manifestly to the great detriment of his legs , which , deprived of their usual portion , trembled beneath him .
