# text = At length , Maria Lobbs being more strenuously urged by the love - worn little man , turned away her head , and whispered her cousin to say , or at all events Kate did say , that she felt much honoured by Mr . Pipkin's addresses ; that her hand and heart were at her father's disposal ; but that nobody could be insensible to Mr . Pipkin's merits .
