# text = The next day , Nathaniel Pipkin saw old Lobbs go out upon his old gray pony , and after a great many signs at the window from the wicked little cousin , the object and meaning of which he could by no means understand , the bony apprentice with the thin legs came over to say that his master wasn't coming home all night , and that the ladies expected Mr . Pipkin to tea , at six o'clock precisely .
