# text = An old oak afforded a pleasant shelter to the group , and a rich prospect of arable and meadow land , intersected with luxuriant hedges , and richly ornamented with wood , lay spread out before them said Mr . Pickwick ; the skin of whose expressive countenance was rapidly peeling off , with exposure to the sun replied Wardle said Mr . Pickwick ; the satisfaction of whose countenance , after drinking it , bore testimony to the sincerity of the reply said Mr . Pickwick , smacking his lips continued Mr . Pickwick , still retaining his hold upon the jar The toast was drunk with loud acclamations said Mr .
