# text = And Mr . Pickwick and Sam entered accordingly inquired Mr . Pickwick , gently , advancing , hat in hand , towards the partition replied the voice ; and at the same time the head to which the voice belonged , with a pen behind its ear , looked over the partition , and at Mr . Pickwick . it was a ragged head , the sandy hair of which , scrupulously parted on one side , and flattened down with pomatum , was twisted into little semi-circular tails round a flat face ornamented with a pair of small eyes , and garnished with a very dirty shirt collar , and a rusty black stock said the man to whom the head belonged inquired Mr . Pickwick
