# text = After a few minutes' silence , Mr . Dodson , a plump , portly , stern-looking man , with a loud voice , appeared ; and the conversation commenced said Fogg said Dodson replied Mr . Pickwick said Dodson said Fogg , thrusting his hands into his trousers' pockets , and throwing himself back in his chair said Dodson said Mr . Pickwick , gazing placidly on the two partners Fogg had ejaculated this much , when he was stopped by Dodson said Dodson said Fogg continued Dodson , with moral elevation in his air Here Dodson drew himself up , with an air of offended virtue , and looked at Fogg , who thrust his hands farther in his pockets , and nodding his head sagely , said , in a tone of the fullest concurrence said Mr . Pickwick , with considerable pain depicted in his countenance replied Dodson replied Fogg , with a smile of incredulity continued Dodson said Fogg , handing over a square book , with a parchment cover resumed Dodson Dodson coughed and looked at Fogg , who said also .
