# text = Pickwick compromise it then , even if he had been so disposed said Dodson , displaying a slip of parchment in his right hand , and affectionately pressing a paper copy of it , on Mr . Pickwick with his left said Mr . Pickwick , rising in person and wrath at the same time said Fogg , rubbing his hands said Dodson , opening the door said the excited Mr . Pickwick , turning round on the landing interposed Dodson , with great politeness said the two clerks , appearing at the bottom of the stairs replied Dodson said Mr . Pickwick , thoroughly roused said Dodson said Fogg said Dodson said Mr . Pickwick said Dodson said Wicks added Mr . Fogg As Fogg put himself very temptingly within the reach of Mr . Pickwick's clenched fist , there is little doubt that that gentleman would have complied with his earnest entreaty , but for the interposition of Sam , who , hearing the dispute , emerged from the office , mounted the stairs , and seized his master by the arm said Mr . Weller
