# text = As the little old man concluded , he looked round on the attentive faces of his wondering auditory with a smile of grim delight said Mr . Pickwick , minutely scanning the old man's countenance , by the aid of his glasses said the little old man exclaimed Mr . Pickwick involuntarily replied the little old man , with a diabolical leer ; and then , without pausing for an answer , he continued added the old man , with a shrewd look round the table said the man in the Mosaic studs , lighting a fresh cigar exclaimed the old man , with a look of excessive contempt he added , turning to Lowten observed the owner of the Mosaic decorations said Mr . Pickwick said Lowten
