# text = The street is broad , the shops are spacious , the noise of passing vehicles , the footsteps of a perpetual stream of people -- all the busy sounds of traffic , resound in it from morn to midnight ; but the streets around are mean and close ; poverty and debauchery lie festering in the crowded alleys ; want and misfortune are pent up in the narrow prison ; an air of gloom and dreariness seems , in my eyes at least , to hang about the scene , and to impart to it a squalid and sickly hue .
