# text = And the red-haired man , who was an important-looking , sharp-nosed , mysterious-spoken personage , with a bird-like habit of giving his head a jerk every time he said anything , smiled as if he had made one of the strangest discoveries that ever fell to the lot of human wisdom said Mr . Pickwick said the new-comer said Mr . Weller , joining in the conversation , with an affable smile said the red-haired man , surveying Mr . Weller from head to foot with a supercilious look replied Mr . Pickwick , in a low tone said the red-haired man replied Mr . Pickwick , much amused by the abruptness of the question , and the singular manner of the stranger said the red-haired man , placing the card in his pocket - book said Mr . Pickwick , wholly unable to repress a smile resumed Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick , rather envying the ease with which Mr . Magnus's friends were entertained .
