# text = Although he had hastily Put on his hat over his nightcap , after the manner of the old patrol ; although he carried his shoes and gaiters in his hand , and his coat and waistcoat over his arm ; nothing could subdue his native politeness said Mr . Pickwick , bowing very low said the lady said Mr . Pickwick , opening the door , and dropping both his shoes with a crash in so doing resumed Mr . Pickwick , gathering up his shoes , and turning round to bow again But before Mr . Pickwick could conclude the sentence , the lady had thrust him into the passage , and locked and bolted the door behind him .
