# text = Trotter made no reply ; for the little pink pocket-handkerchief was in full force repeated Mr . Weller , in a threatening manner said Mr . Trotter , with a look of virtuous surprise Wery hard , indeed , I s'pose ?' said Sam drily replied Mr . Trotter , without moving a muscle of his face Sam eyed his companion for a few seconds , and then , as if actuated by a sudden impulse , complied with his request said Job Trotter , as they walked away There was a momentary look of deep slyness in Job Trotter's eye , as he said this , which ran a thrill through Mr . Weller's clenched fist , as he burned with a desire to make a demonstration on his ribs .
