# text = Trotter pulled forth the pink handkerchief , and wept copiously said Sam replied Job , heaving a deep sigh said Sam At these words , Mr . Job Trotter inserted an end of the pink handkerchief into the corner of each eye , one after the other , and began to weep copiously said Sam , indignantly said Job , after a short pause said Mr . Weller replied Job said Sam , as they had now arrived near the hotel , ' I vant to have a little bit o ' talk with you , Job ; so if you're not partickler engaged , I should like to see you at the Great White Horse to - night , somewheres about eight o'clock said Job replied Sam , with a very meaning look said Mr . Trotter ; and wringing Sam's hand with the utmost fervour , he walked away said Sam , looking after him Having uttered this soliloquy , and looked after Job till he was to be seen no more , Mr .
