# text = Whether it was done in good time , or not , will be seen hereafter When Mr . Pickwick descended to the room in which he and Mr . Peter Magnus had spent the preceding evening , he found that gentleman with the major part of the contents of the two bags , the leathern hat-box , and the brown-paper parcel , displaying to all possible advantage on his person , while he himself was pacing up and down the room in a state of the utmost excitement and agitation said Mr . Peter Magnus replied Mr . Pickwick , surveying the garments of Mr . Peter Magnus with a good-natured smile said Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Pickwick replied Mr . Magnus observed Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Peter Magnus replied Mr . Pickwick
