# text = Down they sat to breakfast , but it was evident , notwithstanding the boasting of Mr . Peter Magnus , that he laboured under a very considerable degree of nervousness , of which loss of appetite , a propensity to upset the tea-things , a spectral attempt at drollery , and an irresistible inclination to look at the clock , every other second , were among the principal symptoms tittered Mr . Magnus , affecting cheerfulness , and gasping with agitation replied Mr . Pickwick .
