# text = There was a brief pause said Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Pickwick , with great energy said Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Magnus , taking another look at the clock , the hand of which was verging on the five minutes past said Mr . Pickwick , with the profound solemnity with which that great man could , when he pleased , render his remarks so deeply impressive said Mr . Magnus resumed Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Magnus continued Mr . Pickwick , growing warmer as the subject presented itself in more glowing colours before him said Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick Mr . Magnus started ; gazed on Mr . Pickwick's intelligent face , for a short time in silence ; and then ( the dial pointing to the ten minutes past ) shook him warmly by the hand , and rushed desperately from the room .
