# text = So the lady screamed , and Mr . Pickwick started exclaimed Mr . Magnus , lost in astonishment added Mr . Magnus , in a threatening , and a louder tone said Mr . Pickwick , somewhat indignant at the very sudden manner in which Mr . Peter Magnus had conjugated himself into the imperative mood said Mr . Magnus replied Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Peter Magnus repeated the middle-aged lady , hesitating replied Mr . Magnus , with ferocity replied the middle-aged lady inquired Mr . Magnus said the middle-aged lady , rising from her seat , and averting her head said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Magnus said the middle-aged lady ; here she wept very copiously indeed interposed Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Magnus said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Magnus Here Mr . Peter Magnus indulged in a prolonged sneer ; and taking off his green spectacles -- which he probably found superfluous in his fit of jealousy -- rolled his little eyes about , in a manner frightful to behold said Mr . Magnus ; and then he repeated the sneer with increased effect said Mr . Pickwick replied Mr . Magnus , striding up and down the room
