# text = There must be something very comprehensive in this phrase of for we do not recollect to have ever witnessed a quarrel in the street , at a theatre , public room , or elsewhere , in which it has not been the standard reply to all belligerent inquiries Never mind , sir Never mind , sir It is observable , too , that there would appear to be some hidden taunt in this universal which rouses more indignation in the bosom of the individual addressed , than the most lavish abuse could possibly awaken .
