# text = The obsequious Muzzle retired , and presently returned , introducing the elderly gentleman in the top-boots , who was chiefly remarkable for a bottle-nose , a hoarse voice , a snuff - coloured surtout , and a wandering eye said the magistrate replied Grummer said the magistrate , in a determined manner said Jinks said the magistrate , signing the warrants Mr . Grummer intimated , by a retrospective shake of the head , that he should never forget it -- as indeed it was not likely he would , so long as it continued to be cited daily said the magistrate said Mr .
