# text = Accordingly , the special was abused , vehemently , for a quarter of an hour , and sent about his business ; and Grummer , Dubbley , Muzzle , and all the other specials , murmured their admiration of the magnanimity of Mr . Nupkins said the magistrate Grummer was sworn directly ; but as Grummer wandered , and Mr . Nupkins's dinner was nearly ready , Mr . Nupkins cut the matter short , by putting leading questions to Grummer , which Grummer answered as nearly in the affirmative as he could .
