# text = He sat on the same side as Mr . Weller , senior ; and every time he could contrive to do so , unseen by his wife , that gentleman indicated to his son the hidden emotions of his bosom , by shaking his fist over the deputy-shepherd's head ; a process which afforded his son the most unmingled delight and satisfaction , the more especially as Mr . Stiggins went on , quietly drinking the hot pine-apple rum-and-water , wholly unconscious of what was going forward .
