# text = The coachman throws down the reins and gets down himself , and the other outside passengers drop down also ; except those who have no great confidence in their ability to get up again ; and they remain where they are , and stamp their feet against the coach to warm them -- looking , with longing eyes and red noses , at the bright fire in the inn bar , and the sprigs of holly with red berries which ornament the window .
