# text = First , there was Wardle himself , looking , if that were possible , more jolly than ever ; then there were Bella and her faithful Trundle ; and , lastly , there were Emily and some eight or ten young ladies , who had all come down to the wedding , which was to take place next day , and who were in as happy and important a state as young ladies usually are , on such momentous occasions ; and they were , one and all , startling the fields and lanes , far and wide , with their frolic and laughter .
