# text = There was a glorious supper downstairs , notwithstanding , and a good long sitting after it ; and when Mr . Pickwick awoke , late the next morning , he had a confused recollection of having , severally and confidentially , invited somewhere about five-and-forty people to dine with him at the George and Vulture , the very first time they came to London ; which Mr . Pickwick rightly considered a pretty certain indication of his having taken something besides exercise , on the previous night inquired Sam of Emma replied Emma said Mr . Weller ; ' I never see such a sensible sort of man as he is , or such a reg'lar gen'l'm'n said the fat boy , joining in the conversation
