# text = From the centre of the ceiling of this kitchen , old Wardle had just suspended , with his own hands , a huge branch of mistletoe , and this same branch of mistletoe instantaneously gave rise to a scene of general and most delightful struggling and confusion ; in the midst of which , Mr . Pickwick , with a gallantry that would have done honour to a descendant of Lady Tollimglower herself , took the old lady by the hand , led her beneath the mystic branch , and saluted her in all courtesy and decorum .
