# text = As he went his way , up the ancient street , he saw the cheerful light of the blazing fires gleam through the old casements , and heard the loud laugh and the cheerful shouts of those who were assembled around them ; he marked the bustling preparations for next day's cheer , and smelled the numerous savoury odours consequent thereupon , as they steamed up from the kitchen windows in clouds .
