# text = It was at this moment , when old Wardle and Sam Weller were approaching the hole with cautious steps , and Mr . Benjamin Allen was holding a hurried consultation with Mr . Bob Sawyer on the advisability of bleeding the company generally , as an improving little bit of professional practice -- it was at this very moment , that a face , head , and shoulders , emerged from beneath the water , and disclosed the features and spectacles of Mr . Pickwick bawled Mr . Snodgrass roared Mr . Winkle , deeply affected .
