# text = Before they separated , however , that gentleman and Mr . Benjamin Allen drew Mr . Pickwick aside with an air of some mystery ; and Mr . Bob Sawyer , thrusting his forefinger between two of Mr . Pickwick's ribs , and thereby displaying his native drollery , and his knowledge of the anatomy of the human frame , at one and the same time , inquired Mr . Pickwick replied that he was at present suspended at the George and Vulture said Bob Sawyer replied Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Bob Sawyer , producing a card said Mr . Pickwick said Mr . Bob Sawyer Mr . Pickwick expressed the pleasure it would afford him to meet the medical fellows ; and after Mr . Bob Sawyer had informed him that he meant to be very cosy , and that his friend Ben was to be one of the party , they shook hands and separated .
