# text = If our observant lady readers can deduce any satisfactory inferences from these facts , we beg them by all means to do so Scattered about , in various holes and corners of the Temple , are certain dark and dirty chambers , in and out of which , all the morning in vacation , and half the evening too in term time , there may be seen constantly hurrying with bundles of papers under their arms , and protruding from their pockets , an almost uninterrupted succession of lawyers' clerks .
