# text = There is the articled clerk , who has paid a premium , and is an attorney in perspective , who runs a tailor's bill , receives invitations to parties , knows a family in Gower Street , and another in Tavistock Square ; who goes out of town every long vacation to see his father , who keeps live horses innumerable ; and who is , in short , the very aristocrat of clerks .
