# text = Perker gave the fire another very unnecessary poke , and said said Mr . Pickwick , most emphatically Mr . Pickwick gave a heavy blow on the table before him , in confirmation of the irrevocability of his intention said Perker replied Mr . Pickwick hastily replied Perker said Mr . Pickwick rejoined Perker , in utter amazement Mr . Pickwick , however , had made up his mind not only that it could be done , but that it should be done ; and the consequence was , that within ten minutes after he had received the assurance that the thing was impossible , he was conducted by his solicitor into the outer office of the great Serjeant Snubbin himself .
