# text = The door was no sooner opened than all doubt on the subject was removed screamed a voice from the two-pair landing said Bob Sawyer , looking round him with great dismay replied the voice , with great shrillness and rapidity of utterance . ' Ain't it enough to be swindled out of one's rent , and money lent out of pocket besides , and abused and insulted by your friends that dares to call themselves men , without having the house turned out of the window , and noise enough made to bring the fire-engines here , at two o'clock in the morning ?--
