# text = But people who go voluntarily to law , or are taken forcibly there , for the first time , may be allowed to labour under some temporary irritation and anxiety ; and Sam , with a due allowance for the frailties of human nature , obeyed all his master's behests with that imperturbable good-humour and unruffable composure which formed one of his most striking and amiable characteristics .
