# text = These motions , although unquestionably of the greatest assistance to original composition , retard in some degree the progress of the writer ; and Sam had unconsciously been a full hour and a half writing words in small text , smearing out wrong letters with his little finger , and putting in new ones which required going over very often to render them visible through the old blots , when he was roused by the opening of the door and the entrance of his parent said the father responded the son , laying down his pen Mrs .
