# text = Weller , taking off his greatcoat with much deliberation inquired Sam replied the old gentleman Before Sam could interfere to prevent it , his heroic parent had penetrated into a remote corner of the room , and attacked the Reverend Mr . Stiggins with manual dexterity said Sam cried Mr . Weller ; and without further invitation he gave the Reverend Mr . Stiggins a preliminary tap on the head , and began dancing round him in a buoyant and cork-like manner , which in a gentleman at his time of life was a perfect marvel to behold .
