# text = Upon this , Mr . Serjeant Buzfuz prayed a TALES ; the gentleman in black then proceeded to press into the special jury , two of the common jurymen ; and a greengrocer and a chemist were caught directly said the gentleman in black said the greengrocer said the chemist said the chemist , who was a tall , thin , yellow-visaged man said Mr . Justice Stareleigh said the chemist replied Mr . Justice Stareleigh rejoined the chemist said the judge , reddening ; for Mr . Justice Stareleigh's temper bordered on the irritable , and brooked not contradiction answered the chemist said the judge peremptorily .
