# text = The officer had got no further than the when he was again interrupted by the chemist said the chemist replied the testy little judge replied the chemist , in a resigned manner and sworn the chemist was , before the judge could find words to utter said the chemist , taking his seat with great deliberation With this , the tall chemist composed himself into a comfortable attitude , and , assuming a pleasant expression of countenance , appeared to have prepared himself for the worst .
