# text = Phunky , preparing to sit down ; for Serjeant Snubbin was winking at him replied Mr . Winkle Now , if the unfortunate Mr . Phunky had sat down when Serjeant Snubbin had winked at him , or if Serjeant Buzfuz had stopped this irregular cross-examination at the outset ( which he knew better than to do ; observing Mr . Winkle's anxiety , and well knowing it would , in all probability , lead to something serviceable to him ), this unfortunate admission would not have been elicited .
