# text = After a short consultation with Dodson & amp ; Fogg , the learned Serjeant again turned towards Sam , and said , with a painful effort to conceal his vexation rejoined Sam , with the utmost good-humour said Serjeant Buzfuz , recovering his spirits replied Sam ; and at this the spectators tittered again said Serjeant Buzfuz , looking knowingly at the jury replied Sam said Serjeant Buzfuz , brightening up with the anticipation of some important discovery . ' Now , what passed about the trial ; will you have the goodness to tell us , Mr . Weller replied Sam This , of course , drew general attention to Dodson & amp ; Fogg , who looked as virtuous as possible said Mr . Serjeant Buzfuz said Sam At this very unexpected reply , the spectators tittered again , and Dodson & amp ; Fogg , turning very red , leaned over to Serjeant Buzfuz , and in a hurried manner whispered something in his ear said Serjeant Buzfuz aloud , with affected composure Would any other gen'l'man like to ask me anythin '?' inquired Sam , taking up his hat , and looking round most deliberately said Serjeant Snubbin , laughing said Serjeant Buzfuz , waving his hand impatiently .
