# text = The register of the distinguished visitors in Ba-ath will be at the Pump Room this morning at two o'clock ,' replied the M.C rejoined Dowler said the M.C ., again taking Mr . Pickwick's hand , as he rose to go and protesting all the way downstairs that he was most satisfied , and most delighted , and most overpowered , and most flattered , Angelo Cyrus Bantam , Esquire , M.C ., stepped into a very elegant chariot that waited at the door , and rattled off .
