# text = I've had my dinner said the powdered-headed footman replied Sam inquired the powdered - headed footman rejoined Sam , ' for me and the other fash'nables only come last night said the powdered-headed footman observed Sam remarked the powdered-headed footman replied Sam . ' Affable , unaffected , say-nothin '- to-nobody sorts o ' fellers said the powdered-headed footman , taking Sam's remarks as a high compliment inquired the tall footman , producing a small snuff-box with a fox's head on the top of it replied Sam said the tall footman Here , a sharp peal at the bell reduced the powdered-headed footman to the ignominious necessity of putting the fox's head in his pocket , and hastening with a humble countenance to Mr . Bantam's By the bye , who ever knew a man who never read or wrote either , who hadn't got some small back parlour which he WOULD call a study said the powdered-headed footman said Sam , taking a letter with a small enclosure said the powdered-headed footman , rubbing his hands , and following Sam out to the door-step .
