# text = Lounging near the doors , and in remote corners , were various knots of silly young men , displaying various varieties of puppyism and stupidity ; amusing all sensible people near them with their folly and conceit ; and happily thinking themselves the objects of general admiration -- a wise and merciful dispensation which no good man will quarrel with .
