# text = With this view , he sent a special embassy , composed of great noblemen who had nothing particular to do , and wanted lucrative employment , to a neighbouring king , and demanded his fair daughter in marriage for his son ; stating at the same time that he was anxious to be on the most affectionate terms with his brother and friend , but that if they couldn't agree in arranging this marriage , he should be under the unpleasant necessity of invading his kingdom and putting his eyes out .
