# text = Which is an obvious injustice to the memory of King Lud , and a dishonest exaltation of the virtues of King Cole Mr . Pickwick yawned several times when he had arrived at the end of this little manuscript , carefully refolded , and replaced it in the inkstand drawer , and then , with a countenance expressive of the utmost weariness , lighted his chamber candle , and went upstairs to bed .
