# text = He always prints , I know As Sam said this , he did what a great many people do when they are uncertain about the writer of a note -- looked at the seal , and then at the front , and then at the back , and then at the sides , and then at the superscription ; and , as a last resource , thought perhaps he might as well look at the inside , and try to find out from that said Sam , as he unfolded it And , with a very grave face , Mr .
