# text = With this permission and the street-door key , Sam Weller issued forth a little before the appointed time , and strolled leisurely towards Queen Square , which he no sooner gained than he had the satisfaction of beholding Mr . John Smauker leaning his powdered head against a lamp-post at a short distance off , smoking a cigar through an amber tube said Mr . John Smauker , raising his hat gracefully with one hand , while he gently waved the other in a condescending manner replied Sam said Mr . John Smauker observed Sam replied Mr . John Smauker said Sam observed Mr . John Smauker said Sam said Mr . John Smauker , with a sigh rejoined Sam said Mr . John Smauker remarked Sam , ' and wery right the old gen'l'm'n wos , for he drank hisself to death in somethin ' less than a quarter .'
