# text = Mr . John Smauker looked deeply indignant at any parallel being drawn between himself and the deceased gentleman in question ; but , as Sam's face was in the most immovable state of calmness , he thought better of it , and looked affable again said Mr . Smauker , consulting a copper timepiece which dwelt at the bottom of a deep watch-pocket , and was raised to the surface by means of a black string , with a copper key at the other end replied Sam inquired his companion , as they walked towards High Street replied Sam replied Sam said Mr . John Smauker said Sam observed Mr . John Smauker contemptuously said Sam And here , to the great horror of Mr . John Smauker , Sam Weller began to whistle said Mr . John Smauker , agonised at the exceeding ungenteel sound replied Sam As Sam said this , he suited the action to the word , and whistled far louder than before said his new friend , apparently much relieved as they turned down a by-street said Sam , quite unmoved by the announcement of his close vicinity to the select footmen of Bath said Mr . John Smauker said Sam continued Mr . John Smauker replied Sam resumed Mr . John Smauker , with an air of sublime protection inquired Sam replied Mr . John Smauker , pulling forth the fox's head , and taking a gentlemanly pinch replied Sam said Mr . John Smauker , putting forth his fox's head , and elevating his own By this time they had reached a small greengrocer's shop , which Mr . John Smauker entered , followed by Sam , who , the moment he got behind him , relapsed into a series of the very broadest and most unmitigated grins , and manifested other demonstrations of being in a highly enviable state of inward merriment .
