# text = At the conclusion of this speech , everybody took a sip in honour of Sam ; and Sam having ladled out , and drunk , two full glasses of punch in honour of himself , returned thanks in a neat speech said Sam , ladling away at the punch in the most unembarrassed manner possible , ' for this here compliment ; which , comin ' from sich a quarter , is wery overvelmin '.
