# text = He had been staying nearly three weeks with Mr . Bob Sawyer ; Mr . Bob Sawyer was not remarkable for temperance , nor was Mr . Benjamin Allen for the ownership of a very strong head ; the consequence was that , during the whole space of time just mentioned , Mr . Benjamin Allen had been wavering between intoxication partial , and intoxication complete said Mr . Ben Allen , taking advantage of Mr . Bob Sawyer's temporary absence behind the counter , whither he had retired to dispense some of the second-hand leeches , previously referred to Mr .
