# text = Winkle looked somewhat stern at this interruption , and Mr . Pickwick angrily requested his attendant not to jest with one of the best feelings of our nature ; to which Sam replied Mr . Winkle then recounted what had passed between himself and Mr . Ben Allen , relative to Arabella ; stated that his object was to gain an interview with the young lady , and make a formal disclosure of his passion ; and declared his conviction , founded on certain dark hints and mutterings of the aforesaid Ben , that , wherever she was at present immured , it was somewhere near the Downs .
