# text = That ' ere blessed lantern exclaimed Sam peevishly said Mr . Pickwick , turning hastily aside remonstrated Sam exclaimed Mr . Pickwick , turning round again said Sam exclaimed Mr . Pickwick , greatly bewildered by the effects he had so unintentionally produced replied Sam , as Mr . Pickwick , after various unsuccessful efforts , managed to close the slide said Mr . Pickwick said Sam , planting his head against the wall , and making a platform of his back said Mr . Pickwick replied Sam As Sam spoke , Mr . Pickwick , by exertions almost supernatural in a gentleman of his years and weight , contrived to get upon Sam's back ; and Sam gently raising himself up , and Mr . Pickwick holding on fast by the top of the wall , while Mr . Winkle clasped him tight by the legs , they contrived by these means to bring his spectacles just above the level of the coping said Mr . Pickwick , looking over the wall , and catching sight of Arabella , on the other side said Arabella said Mr . Pickwick soothingly said Mr . Pickwick , looking down replied Mr . Weller replied Mr . Pickwick replied Arabella , drying her tears with her handkerchief .
