# text = Having something more than a suspicion of the object of the gentleman's visit , Sam preceded him to the George and Vulture , and , turning sharp round , planted himself in the Centre of the doorway said the man in the rough coat , in an imperious tone , attempting at the same time to push his way past replied Sam , returning the push with compound interest said the owner of the rough coat , raising his voice , and turning white growled the man in the brown coat , who had been gradually sneaking up the court during this short dialogue said the principal , giving Sam another push growled Smouch , giving him another , and a harder one .
