# text = The little attorney burst into a loud laugh , and returning the card to the lame man , informing him it was all a mistake , whispered to Mr . Pickwick as the man turned away in dudgeon , that he was only a bail exclaimed Mr . Pickwick replied Perker said Perker , regaling himself with a pinch of snuff exclaimed Mr . Pickwick , quite aghast at the disclosure replied the little gentleman Saying which , the attorney shrugged his shoulders , smiled , took a second pinch of snuff , and led the way into the office of the judge's clerk .
