# text = Pickwick winced a good deal under the operation , and appeared to sit very uneasily in his chair ; but he made no remark to anybody while it was being performed , not even to Sam , who reclined upon the back of the chair , reflecting , partly on the situation of his master , and partly on the great satisfaction it would have afforded him to make a fierce assault upon all the turnkeys there assembled , one after the other , if it were lawful and peaceable so to do .
