# text = Another man , evidently very drunk , who had probably been tumbled into bed by his companions , was sitting up between the sheets , warbling as much as he could recollect of a comic song , with the most intensely sentimental feeling and expression ; while a third , seated on one of the bedsteads , was applauding both performers with the air of a profound connoisseur , and encouraging them by such ebullitions of feeling as had already roused Mr . Pickwick from his sleep .
