# text = Touched they were ; for , instead of then and there making an attempt to commit man - slaughter , as Mr . Pickwick implicitly believed they would have done , they paused , stared at each other a short time , and finally laughed outright said the Zephyr said the man , extending a hand the size of the yellow clump of fingers which sometimes swings over a glover's door said Mr . Pickwick , with great alacrity ; for , now that the excitement was over , he began to feel rather cool about the legs said the gentleman with the whiskers , presenting his dexter hand , and aspirating the h said Mr . Pickwick ; and having executed a very long and solemn shake , he got into bed again said the man with the whiskers said Mr .
