# text = The conversation exhibiting these unequivocal symptoms of verging on the personal , Mr . Pickwick deemed it a fit point at which to interpose said Mr . Pickwick rejoined that gentleman replied Sam , glancing at Mr . Smangle's whiskers said Mr . Pickwick Whatever hostile intentions Mr . Smangle might have entertained , his thoughts were speedily diverted by the unpacking of the portmanteau ; the contents of which appeared to impress him at once with a most favourable opinion , not only of Mr . Pickwick , but of Sam also , who , he took an early opportunity of declaring in a tone of voice loud enough for that eccentric personage to overhear , was a regular thoroughbred original , and consequently the very man after his own heart .
