# text = Turning these things in his mind , as he mounted the narrow staircase at the foot of which Roker had left him , Mr . Pickwick gradually worked himself to the boiling-over point ; and so excited was he with his reflections on this subject , that he had burst into the room to which he had been directed , before he had any distinct recollection , either of the place in which he was , or of the object of his visit .
