# text = Weller paused when he arrived at this point , and cast a comical look at his master out of the corners of his eyes said Mr . Pickwick , gradually breaking into a smile , in spite of the uneasiness which Sam's obstinacy had given him exclaimed Mr . Weller said Mr . Pickwick rejoined Mr . Weller ; ' and a wery pleasant gen'l'm'n too -- one o ' the precise and tidy sort , as puts their feet in little India-rubber fire-buckets wen it's wet weather , and never has no other bosom friends but hare-skins ; he saved up his money on principle , wore a clean shirt ev'ry day on principle ; never spoke to none of his relations on principle , ' fear they shou'd want to borrow money of him ; and wos altogether , in fact , an uncommon agreeable character .
