# text = Being a wery reg'lar gen'l'm'n , he din'd ev'ry day at the same place , where it was one-and-nine to cut off the joint , and a wery good one-and-nine's worth he used to cut , as the landlord often said , with the tears a-tricklin ' down his face , let alone the way he used to poke the fire in the vinter time , which wos a dead loss o ' four-pence ha'penny a day , to say nothin ' at all o ' the aggrawation o ' seein ' him do it .
