# text = Smangle shook his head in a confidential and sympathising manner at this juncture , Mr . Pickwick felt that he was expected to say something , so he said and looked restlessly at the door echoed Mr . Smangle , with a long-drawn sigh exclaimed Mr . Pickwick added Mr . Smangle said Mr . Pickwick said Smangle , making for the door As Smangle pronounced the last three words , he stopped suddenly , reclosed the door which he had opened , and , walking softly back to Mr . Pickwick , stepped close up to him on tiptoe , and said , in a very soft whisper Mr . Pickwick could scarcely forbear smiling , but managing to preserve his gravity , he drew forth the coin , and placed it in Mr .
