# text = Smangle's palm ; upon which , that gentleman , with many nods and winks , implying profound mystery , disappeared in quest of the three strangers , with whom he presently returned ; and having coughed thrice , and nodded as many times , as an assurance to Mr . Pickwick that he would not forget to pay , he shook hands all round , in an engaging manner , and at length took himself off said Mr . Pickwick , shaking hands alternately with Mr . Tupman , Mr . Winkle , and Mr . Snodgrass , who were the three visitors in question
