# text = Here the old gentleman shook his head from side to side , and was seized with a hoarse internal rumbling , accompanied with a violent swelling of the countenance , and a sudden increase in the breadth of all his features ; symptoms which alarmed his son not a little said the old gentleman , when by dint of much struggling , and various convulsive stamps upon the ground , he had recovered his voice said Sam inquired the old gentleman replied Sam said Mr . Weller , with the tears still running down his cheeks , ' it ' ud ha ' been a wery great accommodation to me if I could ha ' done it , and This conversation brought them to the door of the snuggery , into which Sam -- pausing for an instant to look over his shoulder , and cast a sly leer at his respected progenitor , who was still giggling behind -- at once led the way said Sam , politely saluting the lady said Mrs .
