# text = The good lady began by protesting that she couldn't touch a drop -- then took a small drop -- then a large drop -- then a great many drops ; and her feelings being of the nature of those substances which are powerfully affected by the application of strong waters , she dropped a tear with every drop of negus , and so got on , melting the feelings down , until at length she had arrived at a very pathetic and decent pitch of misery .
