# text = After looking from Job to Jingle , and from Jingle to Job in profound silence , he softly ejaculated the words which he repeated at least a score of times ; after which exertion , he appeared wholly bereft of speech , and again cast his eyes , first upon the one and then upon the other , in mute perplexity and bewilderment said Mr . Pickwick , looking back exclaimed Sam ; and having established Job's identity beyond all doubt , he smote his leg , and vented his feelings in a long , shrill whistle said Job exclaimed Mr . Weller , surveying his companion's rags with undisguised wonder . '
