# text = This is rayther a change for the worse , Mr . Trotter , as the gen'l'm'n said , wen he got two doubtful shillin's and sixpenn'orth o ' pocket-pieces for a good half-crown replied Job , shaking his head said Job , with a look of momentary slyness replied Sam expressively said Job said Sam replied Job As he spoke , he pointed to his sallow , sunken cheeks , and , drawing up his coat sleeve , disclosed an arm which looked as if the bone could be broken at a touch , so sharp and brittle did it appear , beneath its thin covering of flesh said Sam , recoiling replied Job .
