# text = Bardell's door ; which the heavy gentleman , in direct opposition to , and defiance of , the vixenish ladies , contended was a green door and not a yellow one said the heavy gentleman exclaimed one of the vixenish ladies Upon this the cabman , who in a sudden effort to pull up at the house with the green door , had pulled the horse up so high that he nearly pulled him backward into the cabriolet , let the animal's fore-legs down to the ground again , and paused inquired the driver Here the contest was renewed with increased violence ; and the horse being troubled with a fly on his nose , the cabman humanely employed his leisure in lashing him about on the head , on the counter-irritation principle said one of the vixenish ladies at length
