# text = Pickwick grated the legs of his chair against the ground ; and throwing himself into it , folded his hands and looked sternly -- if Mr . Pickwick ever could look sternly -- at his legal friend said the little man , still busying himself with the knot replied Mr . Pickwick resumed Perker interposed Mr . Pickwick hastily said the little man , untying the bundle , and glancing eagerly at Mr . Pickwick out of the corners of his eyes Hereupon , the little man threw one leg over the other , and made a show of beginning to read with great composure and application said Mr . Pickwick , with a sigh , but softening into a smile at the same time rejoined Perker , deliberately folding up the paper and putting it into his pocket again was Mr . Pickwick's reply retorted Perker said Mr . Pickwick , with affected carelessness replied Perker echoed Mr . Pickwick rejoined Perker , leaning back in his chair and looking steadily at his client said that gentleman retorted Perker firmly ejaculated Mr . Pickwick , rising nervously from his chair , and reseating himself directly afterwards .
