# text = The little man gave a double-knock on the lid of his snuff-box , opened it , took a great pinch , shut it up again , and repeated the words resumed the little man , who seemed to gather confidence from the snuff continued Perker , checking off each position on a different finger , as he laid it down Mr . Pickwick , whose face had been undergoing most surprising changes during this speech , and was evidently on the verge of a strong burst of indignation , calmed his wrath as well as he could .
