# text = And , at last , Mr . Pickwick , fairly argued and remonstrated out of all his resolutions , and being in imminent danger of being argued and remonstrated out of his wits , caught Arabella in his arms , and declaring that she was a very amiable creature , and that he didn't know how it was , but he had always been very fond of her from the first , said he could never find it in his heart to stand in the way of young people's happiness , and they might do with him as they pleased .
