# text = Weller's first act , on hearing this concession , was to despatch Job Trotter to the illustrious Mr . Pell , with an authority to deliver to the bearer the formal discharge which his prudent parent had had the foresight to leave in the hands of that learned gentleman , in case it should be , at any time , required on an emergency ; his next proceeding was , to invest his whole stock of ready-money in the purchase of five-and-twenty gallons of mild porter , which he himself dispensed on the racket-ground to everybody who would partake of it ; this done , he hurra'd in divers parts of the building until he lost his voice , and then quietly relapsed into his usual collected and philosophical condition .
