# text = Weller to his master replied Mr . Pickwick , thrusting his head out of the window inquired Mr . Pickwick exclaimed Mr . Weller , rubbing his hands Mr . Ben Allen and Mr . Bob Sawyer sat together in the little surgery behind the shop , discussing minced veal and future prospects , when the discourse , not unnaturally , turned upon the practice acquired by Bob the aforesaid , and his present chances of deriving a competent independence from the honourable profession to which he had devoted himself observed Mr . Bob Sawyer , pursuing the thread of the subject inquired Mr . Ben Allen , at the same time sharpening his intellect with a draught of beer responded Mr . Bob Sawyer said Mr . Ben Allen said Mr . Bob Sawyer reflectively said Mr . Ben Allen , holding his plate for some more minced veal replied Bob said Mr . Ben Allen , laying down his knife and fork , and fixing his eyes on the visage of his friend inquired Mr . Bob Sawyer added Bob Sawyer , in legal phraseology said Ben quoth Mr . Robert Sawyer , in reply said Mr . Ben Allen contemptuously remarked Mr . Bob Sawyer said Mr . Ben Allen , setting his teeth together , and speaking more like a savage warrior who fed on raw wolf's flesh which he carved with his fingers , than a peaceable young gentleman who ate minced veal with a knife and fork said Mr .
