# text = The first thing the old lady did , was to shake her head a great many times , and began to cry said Bob Sawyer complacently said the old lady rejoined Mr . Bob Sawyer said the old lady , with a slight groan replied Bob Sawyer exclaimed the old lady , starting rejoined Bob , looking wondrous wise said the old lady , more flurried than before said the old lady , twirling her reticule indignantly , and rising as she spoke said Bob Sawyer said the old lady said Bob , all impatience ; for the old lady , although much agitated , spoke with the most tantalising deliberation , as old ladies often do said the old lady , stopping in this place to dry her eyes said Bob , quite forgetting his professional dignity in his anxiety said the old lady slowly said Bob , with great animation replied the old lady inquired Bob eagerly replied the old lady said , or rather shouted , Mr . Bob Sawyer repeated the old lady .
