# text = It is worthy of remark , that Mr . Martin's face was horribly convulsed as he shook hands with Sam at parting , and that he gave vent to a smile and an oath simultaneously ; from which tokens it has been inferred by those who were best acquainted with that gentleman's peculiarities , that he expressed himself much pleased with Mr . Weller's society , and requested the honour of his further acquaintance inquired Sam , when they reached the Bush replied Mr . Pickwick Mr .
