# text = The one-eyed bagman ladled out a glass of negus from the bowl , and drank it ; smoked a long whiff out of the Dutch pipe ; and then , calling to Sam Weller who was lingering near the door , that he needn't go away unless he wanted to , because the story was no secret , fixed his eye upon the landlord's , and proceeded , in the words of the next chapter said the bagman , ' was one of the merriest , pleasantest , cleverest fellows , that ever lived .
