# text = He paused a few moments , and added , less firmly than before replied Bob said Bob , in conclusion With these hurried words , Mr . Bob Sawyer pushed the postboy on one side , jerked his friend into the vehicle , slammed the door , put up the steps , wafered the bill on the street door , locked it , put the key in his pocket , jumped into the dickey , gave the word for starting , and did the whole with such extraordinary precipitation , that before Mr . Pickwick had well begun to consider whether Mr . Bob Sawyer ought to go or not , they were rolling away , with Mr . Bob Sawyer thoroughly established as part and parcel of the equipage .
