# text = But when they emerged on the open road , he threw off his green spectacles and his gravity together , and performed a great variety of practical jokes , which were calculated to attract the attention of the passersby , and to render the carriage and those it contained objects of more than ordinary curiosity ; the least conspicuous among these feats being a most vociferous imitation of a key-bugle , and the ostentatious display of a crimson silk pocket-handkerchief attached to a walking-stick , which was occasionally waved in the air with various gestures indicative of supremacy and defiance said Mr . Pickwick , stopping in the midst of a most sedate conversation with Ben Allen , bearing reference to the numerous good qualities of Mr .
