# text = , Just wot the young nobleman said ev'ry quarter-day arterwards for the rest of his life ,' replied Mr . Weller inquired Sam , glancing at the driver , after a short silence , and lowering his voice to a mysterious whisper --' wos you ever called in , when you wos replied Bob Sawyer demanded Sam replied Bob Sawyer inquired Sam , pursuing his catechism rejoined Bob rejoined Sam triumphantly . ' Nor never vill ; and there's another thing that no man never see , and that's a dead donkey .
