# text = This gentleman was shown into the room originally assigned to the patriotic Mr . Pott ; and the waiter remarked , in dumb astonishment at the singular coincidence , that he had no sooner lighted the candles than the gentleman , diving into his hat , drew forth a newspaper , and began to read it with the very same expression of indignant scorn , which , upon the majestic features of Pott , had paralysed his energies an hour before .
