# text = Now , some demon of discord , flying over the Saracen's Head at that moment , on casting down his eyes in mere idle curiosity , happened to behold Slurk established comfortably by the kitchen fire , and Pott slightly elevated with wine in another room ; upon which the malicious demon , darting down into the last-mentioned apartment with inconceivable rapidity , passed at once into the head of Mr . Bob Sawyer , and prompted him for his ( the demon's ) own evil purpose to speak as follows replied Mr . Pickwick , shivering said Bob Sawyer , still prompted by the demon aforesaid replied Mr . Pickwick Mr . Pott yielded a ready assent ; and all four travellers , each with his glass in his hand , at once betook themselves to the kitchen , with Sam Weller heading the procession to show them the way .
