# text = Whether the representatives of the public feeling of Eatanswill were blinded by animosity , or ( being both acute reasoners ) saw the advantage of having a third party between them to bear all the blows , certain it is that they paid not the slightest attention to Mr . Pickwick , but defying each other with great spirit , plied the carpet-bag and the fire-shovel most fearlessly .
