# text = Thus admonishing him , the pretty housemaid pushed Sam against the wall , declaring that he had tumbled her cap , and put her hair quite out of curl added Mary inquired Sam replied Mary With these words , after many pretty little coquettish doubts and fears , and wishes that she might not have lost it , Mary produced the letter from behind the nicest little muslin tucker possible , and handed it to Sam , who thereupon kissed it with much gallantry and devotion said Mary , adjusting the tucker , and feigning unconsciousness
