# text = I have done this ," she says , " and I've vasted time and substance on them as has done it more than me ; but I hope ven I'm gone , Veller , that you'll think on me as I wos afore I know'd them people , and as I raly wos by natur said the old gentleman , stifling a sigh with his pipe said Sam , venturing to offer a little homely consolation , after the lapse of three or four minutes , consumed by the old gentleman in slowly shaking his head from side to side , and solemnly smoking , ' vell , gov'nor , ve must all come to it , one day or another said Mr .
