# text = ' Sammy , if I wos to stop here alone vun week -- only vun week , my boy -- that ' ere ' ooman inquired Sam replied his father observed Sam , smiling replied Mr . Weller , poking the fire vehemently Mr . Weller paused with an aspect of intense disgust , and looking round , added in a whisper , ' They wos all widders , Sammy , all on 'em Sam gave a comical look in reply , and the old gentleman having broken an obstinate lump of coal , with a countenance expressive of as much earnestness and malice as if it had been the head of one of the widows last-mentioned , said interrupted Sam .
