# text = Having got thus far , he looked about him again , and sighed grievously ; with that , he walked softly into the bar , and presently returning with the tumbler half full of pine-apple rum , advanced to the kettle which was singing gaily on the hob , mixed his grog , stirred it , sipped it , sat down , and taking a long and hearty pull at the rum-and-water , stopped for breath .
