# text = The individual appealed to , surveyed Mr . Lowten's eyes from a distance , and expressed his opinion that no unusual queerness was perceptible in those features said Lowten inquired Mr . Pickwick replied Mr . Lowten said Mr . Pickwick hastily said Lowten , mending his pen said Mr . Pickwick resumed Lowten , scraping the back of the pen preparatory to making a fresh split said Mr . Pickwick , with a smile replied Lowten exclaimed Mr . Pickwick replied Lowten said Mr . Pickwick , with glistening eyes replied Lowten , nibbing the pen with a contemptuous face Mr . Lowten concluded with a loud laugh , half in jocularity , and half in derision , which was prematurely cut short by the sound of Perker's footsteps on the stairs , at the first approach of which , he vaulted on his stool with an agility most remarkable , and wrote intensely .
