# text = They had no sooner arrived at this point , than a most violent and startling knocking was heard at the door ; it was not an ordinary double-knock , but a constant and uninterrupted succession of the loudest single raps , as if the knocker were endowed with the perpetual motion , or the person outside had forgotten to leave off exclaimed Perker , starting said Mr . Pickwick , as if there could be the smallest doubt of the fact .
