# text = The fat boy went into the next room ; and , having been absent about a minute , returned with the snuff-box , and the palest face that ever a fat boy wore exclaimed Wardle replied Joe nervously inquired the old gentleman added Ben Allen whispered Wardle across the table Ben Allen replied that he thought he was ; and , as that gentleman had seen a vast deal of the disease in question , Wardle was confirmed in an impression which had been hovering about his mind for half an hour , and at once arrived at the conclusion that the fat boy was drunk murmured Wardle
