# text = Next week , there were more visits to Doctors' Commons , and there was a visit to the Legacy Duty Office besides , and there were treaties entered into , for the disposal of the lease and business , and ratifications of the same , and inventories to be made out , and lunches to be taken , and dinners to be eaten , and so many profitable things to be done , and such a mass of papers accumulated that Mr . Solomon Pell , and the boy , and the blue bag to boot , all got so stout that scarcely anybody would have known them for the same man , boy , and bag , that had loitered about Portugal Street , a few days before .
