# text = So it was entered down on the little books that Boffer was to kill himself within ten days , or Wilkins Flasher , Esquire , was to hand over to Frank Simmery , Esquire , the sum of ten guineas ; and that if Boffer did kill himself within that time , Frank Simmery , Esquire , would pay to Wilkins Flasher , Esquire , five guineas , instead said Wilkins Flasher , Esquire remarked Mr . Simmery said Wilkins Flasher , Esquire Another entry was made in the little books , with the gold pencil-cases ; and Mr . Simmery , having by this time killed all the flies and taken all the bets , strolled away to the Stock Exchange to see what was going forward .
